<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Western Metals year net profit slumps.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Western Metals year net profit slumps.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     6.33 vs 10.30</p>
<p>    Net					3.72 vs 6.29</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)	     1.00 vs 1.50</p>
<p>    Total dividend (cents)	     2.00 vs 1.50</p>
<p>    Sales				   53.39 vs 36.48</p>
<p>    Other income			   3.63 vs 1.55</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			    3.00 vs 5.50</p>
<p>    Abnormal items			  nil vs nil</p>
<p>Dividend is unfranked  </p>
<p>Pay date Nov 1</p>
<p>Reg date Oct 11</p>
<p>    Tax					2.61 vs 4.01</p>
<p>    Interest				 0.07 vs nil</p>
<p>    Depreciation			   7.28 vs 1.46</p>
<p>    Minorities				nil vs nil</p>
<p>NOTE: Western Metals Ltd is a zinc and lead miner.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373 1800</p>
